<title>USA: Washington Mutual Q3 shr down to $0.49.</title>
<headline>Washington Mutual Q3 shr down to $0.49.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary     $0.49		    $0.66</p>
<p> Shr diluted     0.49		     0.64</p>
<p> Net		 40,174		   51,688</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary72,111,550	     70,910,723</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted77,530,410	     76,329,970</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary     $2.04		    $1.88</p>
<p> Shr diluted     1.90		     1.83</p>
<p> Net		 161,062		  144,711</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary72,025,613	     69,493,377</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted77,444,473	     74,912,624</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Washington Mutual Inc.</p>
<p>One-time, after-tax SAIF charge cut Q3 operating profits by $22.5 million.</p>
<p>Company restated 1995 results to reflect January merger with Western Bank.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
